('The Yips', 'Curse', 'common', 1, 'custom', 'A randomly chosen opponent''s golfer takes a 1 stroke penalty in round 3.', 'It''s in your head. Now it''s in your hands.', true),
('Caddie''s Advice', 'Instant', 'common', 1, 'custom', 'Before lock, learn one opponent''s current pick.', '"Trust me. It''s a smooth eight."', true),
